WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
- I could watch game tape or.... '07 Pats
highlights.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.375
- [Belichick:] Do your job.

00:00:06.041 --> 00:00:07.250
- [Voice:] The autumn wind...

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.125
- Ah! Raiders have a mascot?

00:00:10.541 --> 00:00:11.750
I can't get anything to work.

00:00:11.916 --> 00:00:12.500
AHHH!

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.625
IT'S SO CREEPY UP CLOSE!

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:14.875
- Sever him, Raider Rusher.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.791
- This is just disgusting fan service.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:21.000
AHHHHH. ANYTHING BUT THE $40 MILLION DOLLARS!!

00:00:21.541 --> 00:00:23.166
- [cheering]

00:00:27.125 --> 00:00:29.750
- All I have to do is sit in this hot seat and split my focus equally?

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:30.541
This is too easy.

00:00:30.541 --> 00:00:32.500
Or I could give Tyler Allgeier all
the looks.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:33.375
- [Bijan:] Coach! Coach!

00:00:33.375 --> 00:00:35.000
- Our scary mascot is coming for you.

00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:40.166
- [Bowles:] They say mascots come alive
and take out coaches on the hot seat.

00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:42.791
- That's just a myth like the boogeyman
or the divisional round.

00:00:42.791 --> 00:00:44.375
Plus, we don't even have a mascot.

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:46.750
- Every team has a mascot.

00:00:46.875 --> 00:00:48.250
- At ease, Major Tuddy.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.625
Commander outranks Major.

00:00:50.625 --> 00:00:52.750
And as a commanding officer,
I said stand down!

00:00:53.291 --> 00:00:54.500
AHHH! AHHH!

00:00:55.041 --> 00:00:58.125
- I have nothing to fear
but Captain Fear himself.

00:00:58.125 --> 00:00:58.500
AH!

00:00:58.916 --> 00:01:00.500
His unibrow matches his mustache.

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:01.250
AH!

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:02.666
- LOOK OUT, IT'S STALEY!

00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:03.416
- Aw thank you.

00:01:03.416 --> 00:01:05.000
I do think we're a bit of a scary team.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.791
- Not you. Staley Da Bear.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.125
- Sorry, I don't know your confusing lore.

00:01:09.291 --> 00:01:10.875
- Help! He looks sleepy, but he's not!

00:01:11.375 --> 00:01:12.125
[Eberflus:] AH!

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:15.125
- Where's the deadbolt?

00:01:15.291 --> 00:01:16.666
- [Boltman:] The only deadbolt...

00:01:17.375 --> 00:01:18.375
IS YOU.

00:01:18.791 --> 00:01:20.375
- You're not even team-approved!

00:01:20.625 --> 00:01:23.125
- AH! Hey, with your size maybe I could start you at tight end-

00:01:24.291 --> 00:01:26.125
- They wanted me to sit on that hot seat.

00:01:26.291 --> 00:01:28.625
But I have more security than anyone.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.125
- Eventually, we will have to take him out.

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.000
My big headed friend.

00:01:37.583 --> 00:01:40.833
- [Creepy Voice:] OHHH CANADDAAAAA....

00:01:41.208 --> 00:01:42.708
- Yeah? Coach Tomlin?

00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:44.833
I was told you wanted me down from the booth.

00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:47.958
Wait, that magnificent chin.

00:01:47.958 --> 00:01:49.708
That beautiful, American-made I-beam.

00:01:49.708 --> 00:01:51.375
Oh, God. It's Steely MC-

